AreaEvent(0x0,Warp34_11,34,11)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp0_1,0,1)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp0_2,0,2)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp34_1,34,1)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp34_2,34,2)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp9_0,9,0)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp12_0,12,0)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp9_29,9,29)
AreaEvent(0x0,Warp12_29,12,29)
AFEV WaitEventTrapsFlag UnitCleanup 0x6
CauseGameOverIfLordDies
END_MAIN

Dunno:
END_MAIN

Tutorial:
END_MAIN

TrapData:
ENDTRAP

